#: kstars.kcfg:222
msgid ""
"Two-letter code that determines the dates on which daylight savings time "
"begins and ends (you can view the rules by pressing the \"Explain DST Rules"
"\" button in the Geographic Location window)."
msgstr ""
"Twee-Bookstaven-Kode, he leggt de Daag fast, op de de Sommertiet anfangt un "
"ophöört (Du kannst de Regeln ankieken, wenn Du op den Knoop "
"\"Sommertietregeln verkloren\" binnen de Standoortinfo klickst.)"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (UseAnimatedSlewing), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:229
msgid "Use animated slewing effects when changing focus position?"
msgstr "Swojen bi't Ännern vun de Kiekricht animeren"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseAnimatedSlewing), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:230
msgid ""
"If true, focus changes will cause the sky to visibly spin to the new "
"position.  Otherwise, the display will \"snap\" instantly to the new "
"position."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, swojt de Steernkoort sichtbor na de niege Positschoon, wenn Du "
"de Kiekricht ännerst. Anners jumpt de Ansicht direktemang na de niege "
"Positschoon."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FOVNames), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:234
msgid "Name of selected FOV indicators"
msgstr "Naam vun utsöcht SF-Wiesers"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FOVNames), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:235
msgid ""
"The names of the currently selected field-of-view indicators.  The list of "
"defined FOV indicator names is listed in the \"Settings|FOV Symbols\" menu."
msgstr ""
"De Naam vun de opstunns utsöchten Sichtfeld-Wiesers. De List vun fastleggt "
"SF-Wiesernaams lett sik ünner \"Instellen\" -> \"SF-Symbolen\" ankieken."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FadePlanetTrails), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:239
msgid "Fade planet trails to background color?"
msgstr "Planetensporen na Achtergrundklöör övergahn laten"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FadePlanetTrails), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:240
msgid ""
"If true, trails attached to solar system bodies will fade into the "
"background sky color."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, geiht de Klöör vun de Planetspoor na de Achtergrundklöör vun "
"den Heven över."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FocusRA), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:244
msgid "Right Ascension of focus position"
msgstr "Rektaszenschoon vun de Kiekricht"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FocusRA), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:245
msgid ""
"The right ascension of the initial focus position of the sky map, in decimal "
"hours.  This value is volatile; it is reset whenever the program shuts down."
msgstr ""
"De Rektaszenschoon vun de Anfangkiekricht op de Steernkoort, in "
"Dezimaalstünnen. Disse Weert warrt nich wohrt, he warrt bi't Utmaken jümmers "
"wedder torüchsett."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FocusDec), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:249
msgid "Declination of focus position"
msgstr "Deklinatschoon vun de Kiekricht"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FocusDec), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:250
msgid ""
"The declination of the initial focus position of the sky map, in decimal "
"degrees.  This value is volatile; it is reset whenever the program shuts "
"down."
msgstr ""
"De Deklinatschoon vun de Anfangkiekricht op de Steernkoort, in "
"Dezimaalgraad. Disse Weert warrt nich wohrt, he warrt bi't Utmaken jümmers "
"wedder torüchsett."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FocusObject), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:254
msgid "Name of focused object"
msgstr "Naam vun't ankeken Objekt"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (FocusObject), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:255
msgid ""
"The name of the object that should be centered and tracked on startup.  If "
"no object should be centered, set to \"nothing\".  This value is volatile; "
"it is reset whenever the program shuts down."
msgstr ""
"De Naam vun't Objekt, dat Du bi't Opropen in de Mitt hebben un dor "
"achterantrecken wullt. Wullt Du keen Objekt in de Mitt hebben, sett dor nix "
"in. Disse Weert warrt nich wohrt, he warrt bi't Utmaken jümmers wedder "
"torüchsett."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (IsTracking), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:259
msgid "Is tracking engaged?"
msgstr "Mittrecken anmaken"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (IsTracking), group (View)
#: kstars.kcfg:260
msgid ""
"True if the skymap should track on its initial position on startup.  This "
"value is volatile; it is reset whenever the program shuts down."
msgstr ""
"Anmaken, wenn de Steernkoort mit ehr Anfangpositschoon mittrecken schall. "
"Disse Weert warrt nich wohrt, he warrt bi't Utmaken jümmers wedder "
"torüchsett."

