msgid ""
"Apply relativistic corrections due to the bending of light in sun's "
"gravitational field"
msgstr ""
"Steernpositschonen relativistsch richten, ehr Licht warrt binnen de Sünn ehr "
"Swoorkraftfeld ümböögt"

